-never-dies", "storyline": "Werewolves, Lizardmen, Skeletons\u2014 In a world where monsters are part of everyday life, a bottom-rung zombie named Davy braves a deadly dungeon to bring back Julia, the frozen human he loved. Gear up for a delightfully wild, \"BLAZING FAST GROWTH\" action RPG\u2014Stupid Never Dies!", "summary": "Set in a monster-ruled otherworldly dungeon, Stupid Never Dies puts you in control of Davy, a timid zombie living at the very bottom of monster society. Defeat enemies, level up, and collect strange items to grow stronger on your quest to bring Julia, a frozen human girl, back to life.\n\nSteal enemy abilities, customize your undead body with bizarre upgrades, and experience fast-paced combat packed with innovation.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/stupid-never-dies", "videos": [{"id": 170932, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "DFshrV9nHqc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DFshrV9nHqc", "title": "Stupid Never Dies World Premiere Trailer from The Game Awards 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DFshrV9nHqc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 178597, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "X79qvE2i2vQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X79qvE2i2vQ", "title": "Stupid Never Dies Gameplay Trailer - Future Games Show Spring Showcase 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X79qvE2i2vQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 192082, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "U_iwVrIIo6E", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U_iwVrIIo6E", "title": "Stupid Never Dies | Release Date Announcement", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U_iwVrIIo6E/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 182778, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HsRzJnuHtqQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HsRzJnuHtqQ", "title": "Stupid Never Dies | Styles", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HsRzJnuHtqQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 195009, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "k_33MQFuVEY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k_33MQFuVEY", "title